  Default (English) copy for DiPlay.

  Simplified Chinese lives in values-zh; the two files must keep exactly the same
  key set, because Android lint fails the build on MissingTranslation/ExtraTranslation.
  Diagnostics-only strings (the exported report, the session log, internal status text)
  deliberately stay in Kotlin as English literals and must never be moved here.
-->
